    "scenesThatPass": [
      "GLENDORA: That's right!\nHESTER: And we're here in our official capacity as Festival hostesses to invite you to go 'sploring. Ever seen a kissing tree?",
      "JOEY: We are definitely post-feminist here.\nGRANNY BOONE: You are a shine rough. But under them harsh Northern exteriors, I suppose you gals oughta clean up real good!",
      "GRANNY BOONE: To avenge a horror that occurred in this place...\nGRANNY BOONE: ...it's your maker, now, bitch, you'll have to face!\nGRANNY BOONE: Damn, that China Woman had a lot of guts!\nMILK MAIDEN: And she danced real pretty too!",
      "GLENDORA: That reminds me of a joke Granny told me. What's the difference between a rooster and Ellie May?\nHESTER: Well I'm sure I don't know, cousin.\nGLENDORA: A rooster says \"Cock a doodle do\" and Ellie May says \"Any cock will do\"!\nHESTER: That's disgustin'!",
      "HESTER: Ring the dinner bell.\nGLENDORA: It's killing time."
    ]
